                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "2/ The mental strain of working in law enforcement is no joke \u2013 especially for those who patrol our borders. And with suicide among border patrol personnel on the rise, it\u2019s crucial that they get to the specialized treatment & resources they need to maintain their mental health.",
