                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "2/ My team checked the VA\u2019s social media accounts, and one thing was clear: our campaign to educate veterans about the benefits and treatment they qualify for under the PACT Act could be much more aggressive. It shouldn\u2019t be on them to decipher the VA\u2019s services.",
