                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Cancer picked the wrong patient. @RepDanKildee is my dear friend, a mentor, and the definition of a fighter. Nothing is going to get in the way of his work for Michigan, and I know that folks all over our state will be cheering him on as he goes through his treatment.",
