                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The PACT Act does something big: it finally acknowledges that service members who were exposed to toxic burn pits \u2013 basically anyone who served in a war zone \u2013 could have been impacted by that exposure, and enables them to get the specialized treatment they have earned.",
