                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For too long, Oscoda & surrounding communities have lived with the impact of PFAS contamination created by the DoD. These actions \u2013 adding groundwater treatment systems at two new sites \u2013 are a positive step forward, though there is still more work to do. https://t.co/6KHTkexLzQ",
