                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "September is National Suicide Prevention Awareness Month, so this week I invited a dedicated group of veterans & mental health advocates to a roundtable, where I could listen to their stories & we could discuss treatment & how we can keep vets from falling through the cracks. https://t.co/jowtsOjs8N",
