                "quoted_status_profile_username": "RepSusanWild",
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "While Alabama\u2019s IVF ruling has some in Congress walking back their support for bills that would ban the treatment, promises aren\u2019t enough.\n\nI\u2019m cosponsoring the Access to Family Building Act because everyone should have access to IVF and the ability to start a family.",
