                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was the nurses we met that helped my family and I cope with my mom\u2019s cancer diagnosis, and it\u2019s important that we let these vital healthcare professionals practice to the full extent of their education and training.",
